#7. A shopping website gives free delivery if the order amount is at least 71000 or if the customer is a premium member. Write a Python program that asks the user for their order amount and whether they are a premium member, and then prints "Free Delivery" or "Delivery Charges Apply
amount=int(input("enter order amount:)"))
member=input("are you a premium member?(yes/no):")
if amount>=7100 or member=="yes":
  print ("Free Delivery :)")
else:
   print("Delivery Charges Apply :(")
